    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the dimly lit sub-basement of the abandoned Blackwood Research Facility. The air is thick with dust and the faint smell of ozone. Decades ago, brilliant minds worked here on a top-secret communication protocol before the project was abruptly shut down and sealed away. Your mission is to restart the facility's dormant systems and transmit the final distress signal that was never sent. Surrounding you are archaic machines, rusted safes, and cryptic notes left behind by the desperate researchers. You must navigate this web of interconnected devices, deciphering their mechanical logic to restore the network. The only way out is to successfully broadcast the signal, but every machine depends on another in a complex chain of data.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
  },
